msgid ""
"A: The server registers the model under its full path "
"`moonshotai/Kimi-K2-Thinking` by default. When the request uses the short "
"name `Kimi-K2-Thinking` without `--served-model-name` override, the server "
"cannot resolve the model ID. Use `\"model\": "
"\"moonshotai/Kimi-K2-Thinking\"` in requests, or start the server with "
"`--served-model-name Kimi-K2-Thinking` to enable the short name."
msgstr ""
"答：服务器默认使用完整路径`moonshotai/Kimi-K2-Thinking`注册模型。当请求使用短名称`Kimi-K2-Thinking`且未覆盖`--served-"
"model-name`时，服务器无法解析模型ID。请在请求中使用`\"model\": "
"\"moonshotai/Kimi-K2-Thinking\"`，或使用`--served-model-name "
"Kimi-K2-Thinking`启动服务器以启用短名称。"

